# Batched installations

- First determine all missing packages for each installer.
- For installers that support multiple packages, install each installer’s packages with one command rather than one command per package.
- In particular, batch Omarchy package additions with one `omarchy pkg add` command and batch Flatpak installations with one `flatpak install` command.
